// Half the box's diagonal, in millunits.
//
// fx_hyp is exact to 65535, and a room is tens of thousands of millunits across,
// so the extents are halved before they are combined rather than after -- the
// alternative overflows the helper's stated range on any scene bigger than a
// small room.

ed_diag(int[] bb) {
} return int fx_hyp(fx_hyp((bb[3] - bb[0]) / 2, (bb[4] - bb[1]) / 2), (bb[5] - bb[2]) / 2);
